th Esc during the introductory tutorial without leaving the tutorial.Ore InformationAdded Attraction to ore details in storage. This stat is highlighted ","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-10-16T22:21:06Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1846651706683270","verified_at":"2026-10-20T11:52:36Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-3797790-1846651706680802","game_id":"steam-3797790","kind":"announcement","title":"Abyssal Lapidary Joins Steam Next Fest: Public Demo Now Live!","summary":"Hello, Lapidaries! 💎It’s time to pick your ores, cut your gems, and welcome the first guests to Vermilion House!Abyssal Lapidary is joining this Steam Next Fest, and the public demo is available now! Whether this is your first time here, or you took part in our earlier playtest, we’d love for you to pick up your tools and experience the life of a lapidary, from unearthing raw ore to crafting jewelry and running the shop. We’ve also prepared a new gameplay showcase for this Next Fest.\\Trailer Her","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-10-16T09:52:28Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1846651706680802","verified_at":"2026-10-20T11:52:36Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-3797790-1835236783562277","game_id":"steam-3797790","kind":"announcement","title":"Abyssal Lapidary Steam Page Is Live: Playtest Sign-Ups Now Open!","summary":"Hello, Lapidary! 💎 We’re excited to finally introduce Abyssal Lapidary to everyone today. Our Steam store page is now officially live, and we’re opening sign-ups for our very first playtest. We’d love for you to join us and help shape the future of the game! What is Abyssal Lapidary? Abyssal Lapidary is a workshop management game centered around ore identification, crafting, and a touch of risk-taking. You inherit Vermilion House, an old jewelry workshop in the underground city of Fathomholm. Du","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-06-12T03:03:34Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1835236783562277","verified_at":"2026-10-20T11:52:36Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"}],"analyses":[],"news_status":{"steam-3797790":{"last_attempt_at":"2026-10-26T00:46:06Z","status":"ok","all_sources_checked_at":"2026-10-26T00:46:06Z","error_codes":[]}},"news_last_attempt_at":{"steam-3797790":"2026-10-26T00:46:06Z"},"notices":[],"news_sources":{"3797790":{"last_attempt_at":"2026-10-26T00:46:06Z","last_success_at":"2026-10-26T00:46:06Z","status":"ok","error_codes":[]},"4736580":{"last_attempt_at":"2026-10-26T00:46:06Z","last_success_at":"2026-10-26T00:46:06Z","status":"ok","error_codes":[]}},"context_snapshots":[{"schema_version":1,"game_id":"steam-3797790","app_id":3797790,"app_scope":"base","observed_at":"2026-10-26T06:14:21Z","source_url":"https://api.steampowered.com/IStoreBrowseService/GetItems/v1/","context":{"country":"KR","language":"koreana","batch_size":100},"status":"ok","error_code":null,"store_item_success":1,"raw_item_sha256":"759a324d0ad8cb14da54b79451b5b3e1442ea39928384e8178117d4e7b000689","response_sha256":null,"source_fields":{"basic_info":{"short_description":"경영 시뮬레이션 게임 《심연의 보석 세공사》에서 당신은 몰락한 보석상을 물려받아 지하 도시의 다양한 손님을 맞이합니다. 광석을 감정하고 깎아 내며, 보석을 세공하고, 장신구를 디자인하고 제작하세요. 가게를 다시 일으키는 동시에 지층 깊숙이 숨겨진 끔찍한 비밀을 파헤쳐 보세요.","publishers":[{"name":"XD","creator_clan_account_id":32962654}],"developers":[{"name":"Light Worm","creator_clan_account_id":46125869}]},"release":{"is_coming_soon":true,"custom_release_date_message":"출시 예정","coming_soon_display":"text_comingsoon"},"trailers":{"highlights":[{"trailer_name":"New fest PV-EN","trailer_url_format":"steam/apps/${FILENAME}?t=1792143108","trailer_category":1,"microtrai